<h5 id="NEW-Use-case-Access-information-and-tools-on-your-phone-while-on-the-go"><a href="#NEW-Use-case-Access-information-and-tools-on-your-phone-while-on-the-go" class="headerlink" title="NEW Use case: Access information and tools on your phone while on the go"></a><strong>NEW</strong> Use case: Access information and tools on your phone while on the go</h5><p>You are working remotely from your phone. From the mobile app, you open a thread in Gmail and select the Gemini chip to <strong>Summarize this email</strong>. Gemini quickly provides you with a summary of the back and forth so that you can focus on the most important points.</p>
<p>Now, you want to generate a response acknowledging the latest developments. You prompt Gemini in Gmail.</p>
<p>You type:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Write a response to this email letting [them] know that I’ve received the message and will take [action] by [Friday].</p>
</blockquote>
<h5 id="Use-case-Develop-customer-relationships"><a href="#Use-case-Develop-customer-relationships" class="headerlink" title="Use case: Develop customer relationships"></a>Use case: Develop customer relationships</h5><p>Your annual conference is coming up, and your most important prospects will be there. You want to personally invite them to a happy hour. You open Gmail and prompt Gemini in Gmail by selecting <strong>Help me write</strong>. You type:</p>
