<p>Write an email inviting people interested in [focus area] to our happy hour taking place on [date, time] at [trade show event]. Include that we specialize in [focus area].</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Now that the event is over, you want to follow up with customers who came to the happy hour. You open Gmail and prompt Gemini in Gmail by selecting <strong>Help me write</strong>. You type:</p>
