<h5 id="Use-case-Coach-and-train-the-sales-team"><a href="#Use-case-Coach-and-train-the-sales-team" class="headerlink" title="Use case: Coach and train the sales team"></a>Use case: Coach and train the sales team</h5><p>You’ve heard from many team members that they want more learning opportunities. You’re organizing a half-day learning program to support this request. You need to create a schedule, so you open a new Google Doc and</p>
<p>prompt Gemini in Docs by selecting Help me write. You type:</p>
