<p>Create a half-day agenda for an educational session on our latest technology [products] for sales teams. Include time for the product development team to present and include time for lunch.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>As a follow up to the team meeting, you want to highlight different learning opportunities available. You open Google Sheets and prompt Gemini in the Sheets side panel. You type:</p>
