</blockquote>
<h4 id="Business-Development-Manager"><a href="#Business-Development-Manager" class="headerlink" title="Business Development Manager"></a>Business Development Manager</h4><h5 id="Use-case-Nurture-relationships-personalized-outreach-and-thought-leadership"><a href="#Use-case-Nurture-relationships-personalized-outreach-and-thought-leadership" class="headerlink" title="Use case: Nurture relationships, personalized outreach, and thought leadership"></a>Use case: Nurture relationships, personalized outreach, and thought leadership</h5><p>You’re hoping to build deeper relationships with prospective customers that you recently met. You want to draft a template that you can customize for multiple contacts. You open a new Google Doc, and you prompt Gemini in Docs. You type:</p>
