<h5 id="Use-case-Generate-personalized-customer-appreciation-materials"><a href="#Use-case-Generate-personalized-customer-appreciation-materials" class="headerlink" title="Use case: Generate personalized customer appreciation materials"></a>Use case: Generate personalized customer appreciation materials</h5><p>You want to personally thank your customers and check in. You open Gmail and prompt Gemini in Gmail by selecting <strong>Help me write</strong>. You type:</p>
